<Legal title="Privacy">
  <p>This covers atheosstudios.com and the studio's private apps at home.atheosstudios.com.</p>

  <h2>This website</h2>
  <p>
    atheosstudios.com has no accounts, no ads and no analytics. It is served through Cloudflare, which keeps the
    usual short-lived request logs to run and protect the site.
  </p>

  <h2>The private apps</h2>
  <p>
    Home, Kitchen, Supercut, Budget, Smarthome and Planning are for people we invite by name. You sign in with your
    Google account through Cloudflare Access. Google then tells the apps your name, email address and profile photo,
    and nothing else.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your email decides which apps you may open. Your name and photo are shown back to you in them.</li>
    <li>
      What you put into an app, such as recipes or plans, is kept on our own server, with a nightly backup in Google
      Cloud Storage that is deleted after 90 days.
    </li>
    <li>None of it is sold, shared with advertisers, or used for anything but running the apps for you.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Removing your access or your data</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:josh.wollberg@gmail.com">josh.wollberg@gmail.com</a> and we remove your access, along with
    anything you ask us to delete. You can also remove the app from your Google account at
    <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions">myaccount.google.com/permissions</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
